Noct is a command-line filesystem inspection and analysis toolkit for
Unix-like systems. It combines everyday directory listing with focused
inspection modes for ownership, permissions, age, sizes, duplicate files,
scripts, extensions, filesystem boundaries, cleanup candidates, and more.

Noct provides configurable themes, filesystem classification colors,
optional Nerd Font icons, recursive tree views, filtering and sorting,
and ANSI16 themes designed for physical system consoles.
